t Erin\'s age or if she is young.\n10. Therefore, based on the given information, we cannot definitively determine if Erin is furry or not.\n</think>\n<answer>\nThe statement "Erin is furry" is unknown based on the given context.\n</answer>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
