s not cold, we can use the last piece of information: If something is nice and not cold, then it is green.\n     - Erin is nice and not cold.\n     - Therefore, Erin must be green.\n</think>\n<answer>\nThe statement "Erin is green" is true based on the given context.\n</answer>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
