y are green (from the rule "If someone is rough, they are green"), Harry is green.\n\nBased on this analysis, we can conclude that Harry is green. Therefore, the statement "Harry is not green" is false.\n\nThe correct answer is:.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
