rom point 11).\n- **All big, nice people are kind.** (From point 14).\n- **All big, nice people are red.** (From point 15).\n\nSince we don\'t have any direct information about Anne being green or big, we need to check if Anne can be considered nice based on the given information:.\n\n- **Anne is kind.** (From the previous steps).\n- **If someone is kind then they are big.** (From point 10).\n- **Therefore, Anne is big.**.\n- **All big, nice people are kind.** (From point 14).\n- **All big, nice people are red.** (From point 15).\n\nSince Anne is big and all big, nice people are red, we can conclude that Anne is nice.\n\nThus, the statement "Anne is nice" is true based on the given context.\n\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
