rmation provided that contradicts or provides additional information about the squirrel\'s temperature.\n\nTherefore, based on the given information, the squirrel is not cold.\n\nThe correct answer is:.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final option is: ']] 54%|#####4    | 326/600 [1:19:53<39:25,  8.63s/it]
