n7. Since the statement "Dave is green" is false, we cannot conclude anything about Dave\'s color based on the given information.\n8. The statement "Dave is not white" is unknown because we do not have enough information to determine if Dave is white or not.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
