13. Given that we do not have information about Erin\'s age, we cannot definitively determine if Erin is young or not.\n14. Since we do not have enough information to determine if Erin is young or not, we cannot definitively determine if Erin is furry or not.\nTherefore, based on the given information, the statement "Erin is not furry" is unknown.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
