it is young.\n- If something is young and round, it is big.\n- Round things are big.\n\nSince Gary is blue and white, Gary is young. Since Gary is round, Gary is big. Therefore, Gary is round.\n\nGiven this analysis, the statement "Gary is not round" is false because Gary is indeed round.\n\n**Conclusion:**.\nThe statement "Gary is not round" is false.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
